    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@24798",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Volumnia and Virgilia, mother and wife to Martius. They set them down on two low stools and sew.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 14,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 19,
          "end": 27,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@24798/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 102,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 844510,
        "end": 844702,
        "line": 31823,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@24798",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@24994",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VOLUMNIA.\nI pray you, daughter, sing, or express yourself in a more comfortable sort. If my son were my husband, I should freelier rejoice in that absence wherein he won honour than in the embracements of his bed where he would show most love. When yet he was but tender-bodied and the only son of my womb, when youth with comeliness plucked all gaze his way, when for a day of kings’ entreaties a mother should not sell him an hour from her beholding, I, considering how honour would become such a person—that it was no better than picture-like to hang by th’ wall, if renown made it not stir—was pleased to let him seek danger where he was like to find fame. To a cruel war I sent him, from whence he returned, his brows bound with oak. I tell thee, daughter, I sprang not more in joy at first hearing he was a man-child than now in first seeing he had proved himself a man.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@24994/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@24994/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 876,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 844706,
        "end": 845623,
        "line": 31828,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@24994",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VOLUMNIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@25915",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIRGILIA.\nBut had he died in the business, madam, how then?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@25915/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@25915/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 59,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 845627,
        "end": 845716,
        "line": 31844,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@25915",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIRGILIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26008",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VOLUMNIA.\nThen his good report should have been my son; I therein would have found issue. Hear me profess sincerely: had I a dozen sons, each in my love alike and none less dear than thine and my good Martius, I had rather had eleven die nobly for their country than one voluptuously surfeit out of action.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26008/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26008/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 306,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 845720,
        "end": 846059,
        "line": 31849,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@26008",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VOLUMNIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26351",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter a Gentlewoman.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 19,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26351/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 20,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 846063,
        "end": 846142,
        "line": 31857,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@26351",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26434",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEWOMAN.\nMadam, the Lady Valeria is come to visit you.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26434/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26434/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 846146,
        "end": 846234,
        "line": 31861,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@26434",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEWOMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26526",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIRGILIA.\nBeseech you, give me leave to retire myself.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26526/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26526/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 846238,
        "end": 846322,
        "line": 31866,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@26526",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIRGILIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26614",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VOLUMNIA.\nIndeed you shall not.\nMethinks I hear hither your husband’s drum,\nSee him pluck Aufidius down by th’ hair;\nAs children from a bear, the Volsces shunning him.\nMethinks I see him stamp thus and call thus:\n“Come on, you cowards! You were got in fear,\nThough you were born in Rome.” His bloody brow\nWith his mailed hand then wiping, forth he goes\nLike to a harvestman that’s tasked to mow\nOr all or lose his hire.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@26614/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
