      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@30816",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIRGILIA.\nIndeed, madam!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@30816/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@30816/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 24,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 850528,
        "end": 850582,
        "line": 32051,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@30816",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIRGILIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@30874",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VALERIA.\nIn earnest, it’s true. I heard a senator speak it. Thus it is: the Volsces have an army forth, against whom Cominius the General is gone with one part of our Roman power. Your lord and Titus Lartius are set down before their city Corioles. They nothing doubt prevailing, and to make it brief wars. This is true, on mine honour, and so, I pray, go with us.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@30874/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@30874/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 364,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 850586,
        "end": 850984,
        "line": 32056,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@30874",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VALERIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31276",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIRGILIA.\nGive me excuse, good madam. I will obey you in everything hereafter.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31276/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31276/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 78,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 850988,
        "end": 851096,
        "line": 32065,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@31276",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIRGILIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31388",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VOLUMNIA.\nLet her alone, lady. As she is now, she will but disease our better mirth.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31388/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31388/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 84,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 851100,
        "end": 851214,
        "line": 32070,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@31388",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VOLUMNIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31506",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VALERIA.\nIn troth, I think she would.—Fare you well, then.—Come, good sweet lady.—Prithee, Virgilia, turn thy solemness out o’ door, and go along with us.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31506/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31506/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 154,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 851218,
        "end": 851403,
        "line": 32075,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@31506",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VALERIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31695",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIRGILIA.\nNo, at a word, madam. Indeed I must not. I wish you much mirth.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31695/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31695/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 73,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 851407,
        "end": 851510,
        "line": 32081,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@31695",
        "anchor": "sceneI_6.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIRGILIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31802",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VALERIA.\nWell then, farewell.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneI_6.3/p@31802/line-1",
          "start": 0,
